  "description": "Reid Classic 24 Petite | 24 inch step-through bike\nThe Reid Classic 24\" Petite is a stylish, lightweight bike designed for riders aged 10–13 years, teenagers and smaller adults between 130–145cm tall. Combining timeless vintage styling with modern comfort, it's an ideal step up from a kids' bike or a compact option for petite riders.\nThe beautifully designed step-through frame makes getting on and off easy, while the upright riding position provides a comfortable and confident ride. Inspired by classic retro bicycles, the Classic 24\" Petite features elegant styling and quality components designed for everyday cycling.\nWhitewall tyres and vintage-inspired details give the bike a timeless look, while its lightweight design makes it easy to handle around town, on bike paths and during family rides.\nWhether you're commuting to school or work, cruising through the city, exploring the neighbourhood or enjoying a weekend ride, the Reid Classic 24\" Petite combines style, comfort and practicality in a compact package.\nWho is the Classic 24 Petite for?\nThe Classic 24\" Petite Bike is ideal for:\n\n10–13 year olds ready for a larger, more grown-up bike\nTeenagers looking for a comfortable 24\" bike\nSmaller adults between 130–145cm tall\nRiders transitioning from a kids' bike to an adult bike\nRiders who prefer an easy-to-mount step-through frame\nEveryday cycling, commuting, family rides and weekend adventures\n\nFind the right fit\nChoosing the right bike size helps you ride comfortably, confidently and safely. Use our Bike Size Guide by clicking the tab above to find the right Reid bike based on your height and riding needs.",
